305-Highlighting an element over modal windows can be useful when a user wants to report an error via a feedback form, and the form with bug is opened in a modal window.
306-
307:In the `FooterItem` component and in the configuration of the `menuItems` and `subheaderItems` elements, you can pass the `bringForward` property, which displays an icon on top of the modal windows. Additionally, in the `AsideHeader`, you need to pass a function that will notify you when the modal windows are opened.
