310-
--
472-In the expanded sidebar, titles automatically use one or two lines according to the available width.
473-Short titles keep the regular row height; longer titles wrap and increase it. Text beyond the second
474-line is truncated with an ellipsis. This adapts to locale, width and font changes, including nested
475:items, group headers, quick access and `FooterItem`. Icons and tree elbows align with the center of
476-the first text line. The collapsed sidebar keeps fixed-height icons;
477-popup rows remain single-line. More overflow uses the actual row heights. No line-count option is
478-needed: when migrating from a v7 prerelease, remove `titleLines` from your menu data.

